; claude: the applications (see docs/claude_notes/plans/plan_gui_teaching.md):
; whole programs rather than demonstrations of one idea, each Tiny and
; each saying in its header what it deliberately does not do. They sit
; beside games/ and examples/ and are laid out the same way, with
; software/ for the golden frames.
(executables
  (names
    TinyVisiCalc TinyExcel TinyBravo TinyWord TinyMacPaint TinyOpenDoc TinyPowerPoint
  )
  (libraries
    elm_playground
    gui ; Widget, for text_width
    appkit_sheet ; Formula and Sheet, the engine
    appkit_sheet_view ; a sheet drawn into a rectangle (TinyExcel)
    appkit_document ; Undo (TinyBravo, TinyWord)
    appkit_richtext ; text with looks, and its page (TinyBravo, TinyWord)
    appkit_paint ; a picture as bits, and what paints it (TinyMacPaint)
    appkit_embed ; a document of parts (TinyOpenDoc, TinyPowerPoint)
    appkit_slides ; a talk as an outline (TinyPowerPoint)
    graphics_font ; Hershey's strokes, for Stroke_text
    elm_playground_native ; implem of virtual elm_playground
  )
)
